Subsurface Ventilation Engineering — Malcolm J. McPherson (@mine-ventilation: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mine-sources) { r_3KH110VQV6VEA56FVWV8D7W6AY
Malcolm J. McPherson. Subsurface Ventilation Engineering, SRK-hosted authorized English ebook. [Publisher/author-associated book page and free English download](https://www.srk.com/en/products/ventilation-textbook). The related 1993 Springer title is Subsurface Ventilation and Environmental Engineering, DOI 10.1007/978-94-011-1550-6; preserve the actual downloaded edition's title, revision, and notices.

Read the complete English book, including fluid/airflow theory, networks/surveys, fans, environment, heat, contaminants, and engineering application. Whole-book study supports later network and measured-system projects rather than choosing a fan from a single formula.

SRK offers the English ebook free; the page lists different access conditions for Spanish editions. Free reading is distinct from an unrestricted adaptation licence. Metadata, scope, free route, and edition distinction checked on 29 October 2026. No book or external ventilation program is embedded.

